# Drive the impedance equilibrium SMOOTHLY to this TCP pose (base frame), IGNORING
# ~/target_pose until reached. The call blocks until the pose is reached (or timeout/abort).
# If 'pose' is left empty (zero quaternion), the node falls back to its 'home_pose' param
# (see config/impedance_params.yaml) -> calling with "{}" goes to the default home.
geometry_msgs/Pose pose
float64 max_velocity      # m/s cap during homing; <= 0 -> use the node's homing_velocity param
---
bool success
string message
